<https://github.com/john1hsu/aws-graph/id/aws-partitions> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A partition is a group of AWS Regions with its own independent IAM instance, accounts and control plane; every Region and every account belongs to exactly one partition (aws, aws-cn, aws-us-gov, aws-eusc), and partitions form a hard boundary that credentials and most cross-Region features cannot cross." .
