<https://github.com/john1hsu/aws-graph/id/aws-storage-gateway> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "AWS's hybrid cloud storage service: a gateway appliance (VM, or EC2 instance) that runs near on-premises applications and presents Amazon S3-backed storage over standard protocols, as NFS/SMB file shares (S3 File Gateway), iSCSI block volumes (Volume Gateway) or an iSCSI virtual tape library (Tape Gateway)." .
