<https://github.com/john1hsu/aws-graph/id/aws-sts> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The AWS web service that issues short-lived, scoped temporary security credentials (access key, secret key and session token) for assumed IAM roles, federated users and MFA-protected sessions, so people and workloads can reach AWS without long-term access keys." .
