<https://github.com/john1hsu/aws-graph/id/canary-deployments> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A release pattern that exposes a new version to a small, randomly chosen share of production traffic first, watches its health, and only then shifts the rest of the traffic to it, rolling back if the canary misbehaves." .
