<https://github.com/john1hsu/aws-graph/id/ecs-native-blue-green-deployments> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A deployment strategy built into the Amazon ECS deployment controller that starts a new (green) service revision beside the running (blue) one, shifts test and then production traffic to it in managed lifecycle stages, and keeps blue running for a bake period so rollback is near-instant; it also offers linear and canary traffic shifting." .
