<https://github.com/john1hsu/aws-graph/id/hipaa-eligible-services> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "How AWS supports workloads regulated by the U.S. HIPAA rules: customers accept AWS's Business Associate Addendum (BAA) in AWS Artifact, and may then process protected health information only in the AWS services AWS lists as HIPAA eligible, configured under the shared responsibility model." .
